{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">政府多個部門繼續就新皇崗口岸大樓開通做好準備。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">保安局在社交平台發布影片，入境處、消防、救護及警方等多個部門，就入境流程、緊急情況等進行測試。亦提到多次演練，動員超過70個政策局及部門逾3萬名公務員。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-1200_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026L5AV28XGQH1791002550.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER-1200_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，口岸新大樓最快本月12日啟用，將實行「合作查驗、一次放行」，的通關模式，過關時間會縮短至5分鐘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T05:18:25.837871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}